      {
        "id": 226512,
        "name": "FearLord",
        "username": "FearLord",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/5f8ce5/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-04-23T05:35:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ensign53\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ensign53/48/1904_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ensign53:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I swear I didn’t think I did that… I know I went full arcana before I went full bird, then went back to full arcane… Was something flipping them that I didn’t control?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I haven’t looked at your log, but Uncontrollable Flock flips one Arcane Token to Avian at the start of your turn with no choice. Conjured Aura lets you change them out of turn when you take damage, but the game offers you a choice for that.</p>",
