        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rysmith6/{size}/1852_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-04-23T19:40:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As a warning, I had all three relics in GW's trash, then Ghostly Images played Direct Strike from Harpy's deck during the Environment Turn before the Villain Turn that would have ended the game.</p>\n<p>Make sure that you have at least a <em>little</em>&nbsp;deck control to make sure that doesn't happen to you, intrepid explorers!</p>",
