      {
        "id": 226515,
        "name": "FrivYeti",
        "username": "FrivYeti",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-04-23T23:21:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ensign53\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ensign53/48/1904_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ensign53:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I swear I didn’t think I did that… I know I went full arcana before I went full bird, then went back to full arcane… Was something flipping them that I didn’t control?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Okay, I went back in and tracked all of the flips, and… uh… I’m not sure what’s going on but it’s something.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Harpy starts with 3 Arcana, 2 Avian<br><br>\nMagical Bequest turned it to 4/1<br><br>\nConjured Aura flipped it back to 3/2<br><br>\nMystic Outburst flipped two to to make it 1/4.&nbsp;<br><br>\nTenuous Focus flipped you to all Avian tokens.<br><br>\nThen you started the flip back:&nbsp;<br><br>\nTenuous Focus flipped you to 1/4<br><br>\nMagical Bequest took you to 2/3<br><br>\nMagical Bequest took you to 3/2<br><br>\nMagical Bequest took you to 4/1<br><br>\nYou accidentally killed the book with Huginn and Munnin, and undid the end of the turn.&nbsp;<br><br>\nHuginn &amp; Muninn took you back to 3/2<br><br>\nThen we get the following line:<br><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n<pre>While in preview mode, a decision made the result unknowable.</pre>\n<p>I think during that time you jumped up to 4 Arcana, 1 Avian, because:&nbsp;<br><br>\nMystical Outburst is listed as flipping three tokens to Avian.<br><br>\nHuginn &amp; Munnin added another flip to Avian, making things 5 Avian.<br><br>\nConjured Aura flipped one token to Arcana.<br><br>\nMagical Bequest gave you a second Arcana.<br><br>\nHuginn &amp; Munnin gave you a third Arcana.<br><br>\nMagical Bequest gave you a fourth Arcana.<br><br>\nMagical Bequest filled your Arcana.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>My guess is that the condition wasn’t filled because you went full Avian, started on the path back to Arcana, then doubled back and filled Avian again before you went full Arcana. The condition might not allow token flipping once you’ve filled one side.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:00:28.519Z",
