        "cooked": "<p>Question will be posted here after I edit 80000 characters out of a Log that this software doesn’t allow me to post.  If ever SOTM returns from death, I hope that Handelabra and &gt;G will work together to create a more streamlined method of log sharing and conversion for readability.</p>",
