        "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:41:10.052Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That would solely be on Handelabra if you want the log sharing and output altered.  You can make a request through the feedback in the app or here <a href=\"https://www.handelabra.com/contact\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Contact Us — Handelabra Games</a></p>\n<p>Also, the SotM app still gets big fixes and MigrantP still sets up a weekly one shot so it’s not dead on that end.</p>",
